# ==========================================
# Hachi Runtime (user-generated, not source)
# ==========================================
# T-74: narrowed from unanchored (repo-wide) globs, which is what hid 52.6 MB of
# design trees from every git command with no signal — `git add` succeeded,
# `git status` stayed clean, the files never landed. Anchored to the repo root only
# (leading `/`) so a tracked fixture/docs/test image or HTML file in any
# subdirectory stays trackable. No code path in this repo writes generated
# png/jpg/jpeg/gif/html into the working tree — the seven named design trees
# above are covered by their own by-name rules, and real runtime output goes to
# platformdirs paths outside the repo, or `.hachi/` (already ignored, line 79).
# This rule only catches a stray file dropped directly at the repo root.
# `!frontend/index.html` is now dead — the anchored rule below never reaches
# frontend/ — so it is removed rather than kept as an inert fossil.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.html

# ==========================================
# Environment & Secrets
# ==========================================
.env
.env.local
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
token.json

# ==========================================
# Hachi user settings (contain credentials)
# ==========================================
settings.toml
**/.hachi/settings.toml
# Local Docker self-host runtime dir — holds the gateway token secret the compose recipe
# reads (./.hachi/gateway_api_token.txt). Never commit it.
.hachi/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Design-tool working trees (Claude Design / DesignSync / Stitch exports).
# Source material, NOT build output — see docs/DECISIONS.md before removing any.
# Named explicitly (T-74) so the asset globs below can be narrowed to repo-root only
# without silently un-hiding these trees again.
# `design-system/` is the seventh design tree but is TRACKED (65 files); its
# disposition is a flagged decision for the user, recorded in docs/DECISIONS.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.ds-sync/
ds-bundle/
.design-bundle/
.design-sync/
.stitch-review/
/Hachi Web UI/
.claude/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/
.claude/skills/banner-design/
.claude/skills/brand/
.claude/skills/design/
.claude/skills/design-system/
.claude/skills/ui-styling/
.claude/skills/slides/


node_modules/
frontend/.vite/
# T-74: frontend/.tanstack/ is currently empty (TanStack Router's cache dir) so it never
# appears in `git status` yet -- but it is genuinely unignored today. The moment the router
# writes a cache file there it would land in status with no code change to explain it.
frontend/.tanstack/